<h1>Study Spanish Guatemala</h1>
<p>&nbsp;In January 2024, Abby Wooster, a student at Whitworth University in Spokane, Washington, traveled to Quetzaltenango, Guatemala, to take part in a three-week Spanish immersion program. Her goal was to strengthen her Spanish through an intensive learning experience while becoming more familiar with the language and culture in an environment where Spanish was part of daily life.</p>
